# Copy this file to .dev.vars (gitignored) and fill in a real value for
# local `wrangler dev` and `npm test`. In production, set the same name
# with `wrangler secret put BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` instead - never put a real
# secret in wrangler.jsonc's committed "vars".
#
# Generate one with: openssl rand -base64 32
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=replace-with-a-real-random-secret-at-least-32-chars
